From 662dcc2782d6b3fdbcbf7197d1476bc1b32b7175 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:32:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] meson: link what libphonenumber's headers need from protobuf

libphonenumber's public headers include protobuf's generated headers,
and with protobuf 22 and later their inline code calls into abseil's
logging (CheckOpMessageBuilder and LogMessage). mmsd-tng finds
libphonenumber with find_library(), which brings no dependencies, so
whether it links depends on what the compiler happened to inline. On
aarch64 with protobuf 33 and GCC 15 it does not:

  phone-utils.cpp.o: undefined reference to symbol
  '_ZN4absl12lts_2026010712log_internal21CheckOpMessageBuilder9NewStringEv'

Add protobuf's pkg-config dependency, which carries the abseil libraries.
It is optional, so a build against a libphonenumber that does not need it
is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 meson.build      | 5 ++++-
 unit/meson.build | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 2cd3db8..97a0475 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -119,7 +119,10 @@ dependencies = [
   dependency('libsoup-3.0'),
   dependency('libcares', version : '>=1.18.1'),
   cc.find_library('dl'),
-  cc.find_library('phonenumber', required: true)
+  cc.find_library('phonenumber', required: true),
+  # libphonenumber's headers include protobuf's, whose inline code calls
+  # into abseil: link what protobuf.pc says those need.
+  dependency('protobuf', required: false),
 ]
 
 subdir('src')
diff --git a/unit/meson.build b/unit/meson.build
index cf485ef..b6eadc3 100644
--- a/unit/meson.build
+++ b/unit/meson.build
@@ -3,7 +3,8 @@ test_dependencies = [
   dependency('mm-glib', version : '>=1.14'),
   dependency('libcares', version : '>1.17'),
   cc.find_library('dl'),
-  cc.find_library('phonenumber', required: true)
+  cc.find_library('phonenumber', required: true),
+  dependency('protobuf', required: false),
 ]
 
 test_mmsutil = executable('test-mmsutil',
-- 
